                "content": "```\nInput: expression = \"2*3-4*5\"\nOutput: [-34,-14,-10,-10,10]\nExplanation:\n(2*(3-(4*5))) = -34\n((2*3)-(4*5)) = -14\n((2*(3-4))*5) = -10\n(2*((3-4)*5)) = -10\n(((2*3)-4)*5) = 10\n```"
